降临的一道幽影···</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">暮月低语</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">攻击被时空减速的敌人时，对目标及附近敌人造成1,000点物理伤害和1,500点冰冻元素伤害，冷却时间5.0秒</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">暗夜之使</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色物理和元素伤害提高15%。出场时，额外提高角色全伤害50%，持续5.0秒。角色在场时每过30秒会再次触发一次该增益 。使用必杀技时会重置冷却时间并立即触发该增益。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">精准补给、活动补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">置换空间</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">置换空间兑换（概率刷出）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗大伟哥黑金卡兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">第一期（V3.3）、第五期（V3.7）作战工坊限时兑换</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%